      "description": "Well, I guess that explains why Curly didn't come back for lunch break. Looks like I have to bail him out again -- typical. The way he makes me worry, I swear, I'll be gray in a year.\r\n\r\nCome on, we'll have to save him ourselves, and it sounds like we don't have much time.",
